A set of language packs for Jet Event System v2 

== Description ==

<strong>en/ru</strong> Support for 2 languages (поддержка 2 языков):
* en_EN
* ru_RU

See <a href="http://jes.milordk.ru">Official website of the plugin</a>

== Installation ==

1. Upload `jet-event-system-v2-lang` folder to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress

